  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIRCO Hub Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment supports the setup and rollout of a self-sufficient CIRCO Hub in Algeria. The main objective is to create a functioning and self-sufficient CIRCO Hub in Algeria that supports SME-led circular transformation, connects to solar-related industries, and strengthens Dutch-Algerian collaboration on sustainable production. The Hub will organize design-based circular economy Tracks, awareness sessions, and workshops. These activities will help Algerian companies reduce waste and material use, improve supply chains, and develop sustainable business models.The aim is to empower the Hub to be independent and self-sufficient; activate companies to join; apply the design methodology for companies and designers; run a circular community driving a circular transition.</narrative>
  </description>
